    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naishooki Simeon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki e rubata eare alotu o losho le Simeon te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena; netii apa enjung'ore enye empolos e njung'ore o losho le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.28+1KI.4.29+1KI.4.30+1KI.4.31+1KI.4.32+1KI.4.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 4.28-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neeta apa ninye aitaa enjung'ore enye Beer-sheba, o Sheba, o Molada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Hasar-shual, o Bala, o Esem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Eltolad, o Betul, o Horma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Siklag, o Bet-markabot, o Hasar-susa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Betlebaot, o Sharuhen - nkanas tomon o okuni te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o En-rimon, o Eter, o Ashan - nkanas ong'uan te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nebo nena ang'itie pooki kutiti naamanita kuna anas o metabaiki Baalat-beer, o Rama e Negeb. Ena apa enjung'ore o losho le Simeon te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enjung'ore o losho le Simeon neitayu ematua e nkop e Yuda; amu ore apa erubata o losho le Yuda; naa eidapash oleng te ninche, netum olosho le Simeon enjung'ore te mpolos e njung'ore enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naishooki Sebulon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu erubata e uni te nkaraki olosho le Sebulon, te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena. Ore ina kop e njung'ore enye nelo abaya Sarid; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki ilo polosie alo enkalo o loo ntoluo, nelo abaya Mareal, nelo aikob Dabeshet, neitoki abaya enong'oto natii enkalo o loo saen le Yoknear; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedumunye te Sarid aipir enkae shoto enkalo o loo saen aing'or eneilepunye enkolong o metabaiki olpolosie le Kislot-tabor; nelo te ine o metabaiki Daberat, neitoki ailep alo Yafia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedumunye neim enkalo o loo saen aing'or eneilepunye enkolong o metabaiki Gad-hefer, o metabaiki Et-kasin, nelo o metabaiki Rimon neloja aing'or Nea; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki alo te nkalo e moikuape aboina olpolosie aing'or Hanaton, nelo aiting to erata le Iftahel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Katat, o Nahalal, o Shimron, o Idala, o Betlehem - nkanas tomon o are te nebo nkang'itie enye kutiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye enjung'ore o losho le Sebulon, te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena - kuna anas te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naishooki Isaakar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu erubata e ong'uan te nkaraki Isaakar, te nkaraki olosho le Isaakar te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olpolosie lenye neitushulu Yesreel, o Kesulot, o Shunem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Hafaraim, o Shion, o Anaharat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Rabit, o Kishion, o Ebes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Remet, o Enganim, o Enhadad, o Bet-pases; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelo sii ilo polosie aikop Tabor, o Shahasuma, o Bet-shemesh, nelo ilo polosie lenye aiting te Yordan - nkanas tomon o ile te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye enjung'ore o losho le Isaakar te risioroto oo lmareita lenyena - nena anas te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naishooki Asheri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki alotu erubata e imiet te nkaraki olosho le Asheri te risioroto oo lmareita lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkop enye neitushulu Helkat, o Hali, o Beton, o Aksaf, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Alamelek, o Amad, o Mishal; ore te nkalo o loo ntoluo nelo aikop Karmel o Shihor-libnat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki aibelekenya aing'or enkalo o loo saen, nelo Bet-dagon, o meikobo Sebulon oerata le Iftahel te nkalo e moikuape o meshomo Bet-emek o Niel, neitoki alo te nkalo e moikuape o meshomo Kabul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Ebron, o Rehobu, o Hamon, o Kana o metabaiki Sidon Kitok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki ilo polosie aibelekenya aingor enkalo e Rama, ometabaiki enkanasa nasheta sunta e Turo; neitoki ilo polosie alo ometabaiki Hosa, nelo aiting te naiposha; Mahalab, o Aksib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Uma, o Afek, o Rehob - nkanas tikitam o are te nebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
